        "What do others say?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "During a long period of managing major procurements for government departments I have worked with most (perhaps all) of the major providers of legal services to this sector. I have found Mills & Reeve to be amongst the most effective. UK industry regulator",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Who we are",
        "What do others say?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Confused by all the new Notices under the Act?",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Who we are",
        "What do others say?",
        "Confused by all the new Notices under the Act?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Don't despair - our Notices Generator is here to help. Just as with our Standstill Calculator , answer a few simple questions and watch it generate a printable report setting out which notices are mandatory and optional for your procurement.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Who we are",
        "What do others say?",
        "Confused by all the new Notices under the Act?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
